message:
feat: add per-skeleton crawler config for guided crawling

Supports a "skeletons" map in boneyard.config.json that maps skeleton
names to their routes and per-skeleton wait times. When configured,
the CLI skips route discovery and goes directly to specified routes.

Example config:
{
  "skeletons": {
    "dashboard-stats": { "route": "/dashboard", "wait": 1200 },
    "user-profile": { "route": "/settings/profile", "wait": 600 }
  }
}

Fixes #28.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
